1
00:00:01,835 --> 00:00:03,712
Panic attack from
claustrophobia, right?

2
00:00:03,837 --> 00:00:05,297
-I'll tell them to stop
-No, I'm fine

3
00:00:06,632 --> 00:00:07,758
It's okay

4
00:00:07,883 --> 00:00:08,883
I can do it

5
00:00:14,932 --> 00:00:16,433
We…

6
00:00:19,061 --> 00:00:20,395
had a great time, right?

7
00:00:22,439 --> 00:00:24,858
It was fun cooking
at home…

8
00:00:24,983 --> 00:00:27,402
and also for today's
date at amusement park…

9
00:00:27,527 --> 00:00:28,570
And…

10
00:00:35,244 --> 00:00:36,244
What are you doing?

11
00:00:37,704 --> 00:00:38,704
I turned the camera off

12
00:00:40,624 --> 00:00:41,624
Is it okay to do that?

13
00:00:44,086 --> 00:00:45,126
I don't know, but I had to

14
00:01:09,361 --> 00:01:10,821
Why did you say
you were okay?

15
00:01:10,946 --> 00:01:12,322
We can't get off
in the middle

16
00:01:14,449 --> 00:01:16,535
I already ruined
this show too much

17
00:01:20,998 --> 00:01:22,749
I couldn't do that
until the end

18
00:01:24,793 --> 00:01:26,795
You've always
done great

19
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:27,920
I know that

20
00:01:36,555 --> 00:01:38,056
You don't know about me
